// CH1 - Certutil Download-Abuse - BYPASSED  |  ADE3-01 Process Cloning + ADE2-04
// Rule intent : catch certutil abused to fetch/stage a payload
//               (-urlcache/-verifyctl/-decode) pulling from a URL.
// The bug     : (1) ADE3-01 - keys on the PROCESS NAME (...\certutil.exe); the renamed
//               svc_update.exe misses. (2) ADE2-04 - it also REQUIRES a URL
//               (http/https/ftp) in the command line, but the attacker `-decode`s a
//               LOCAL staged blob (upd.b64) - no URL - so it misses even without the rename.
// Try it      : returns NOTHING on the CTF data (a double miss - rename + local decode).
ProcessCreate_CH1
| where Process endswith "certutil.exe"                          // ADE3-01: renameable
| where CommandLine has_any ("-urlcache","-verifyctl","-decode","-decodehex")
| where CommandLine has_any ("http://","https://","ftp://")     // ADE2-04: assumes a network fetch